Looking at this problem, I need to prove that ∠APB + ∠AQB = 180° where P, Q are intersections of the perpendicular bisector of HD with the circumcircle of BCD.

**Answer-leak check:** The problem statement contains only the problem and constraints — no leaked solution or answer. Proceeding.

